      overview:
        "A curated journey through the best of the Dragon Kingdom. Experience Bhutan's finest cultural sites, from Paro and Thimphu to Punakha, with dzongs, monasteries, and Himalayan vistas. This itinerary showcases the essence of Bhutanese heritage and landscape.",
